          "text": "Following [1.4.269](https://github.com/stablyai/orca/releases/tag/v1.4.269), here is the next round of Orca. Bots reach Qwen Code and span your paired computers, the phone app manages agents end to end, and chats get lighter and quicker. ## Bots across computers, a phone that runs your agents & snappier chats ✨ One bot group can now hold bots from your paired computers, bots can run on Qwen Code, chats can be deleted and continue on their own after a usage limit, and the phone app can share, import and connect agents without the desktop. - 🤖 **Bots across computers and agents:** One bot group…"
