          "date": "2026-11-22",
          "version": "v0.17.3",
          "text": "## 0.17.3 - 2026-11-22 ### Fixed - Fixed iPhone sheets such as Workspace tabs ignoring body swipes to expand, scroll, or collapse ([#10525](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/10525)) - Fixed Antigravity applying the default model's thinking levels to every model, which blocked Orchestrator chats from opening ([#10524](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/10524)) - Fixed `/` and `@` pickers disappearing until reload after returning to a workspace through window history ([#8954](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/8954) by @viking1201)"
        },
        {
          "date": "2026-11-22",
          "version": "v0.17.2",
          "text": "## 0.17.2 - 2026-11-22 - **Turn and session stats:** View per-turn and session timing, token, cache, and cost metrics for Claude, OpenCode v2, Pi, Oh My Pi, and plugin providers. ([#10496](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/10496), [#10510](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/10510)) - **Automatic model list refresh:** Enabled providers refresh their model lists in the background every 30 minutes. ([#10481](https://github.com/getpaseo/paseo/pull/10481)) - **Sidebar usage by default:** The sidebar usage summary is enabled by default, sources for inactive providers start hidden, and sour…"
